Package: postcodElapse
Title: Estimate air pollution concentrations for Dutch postcodes using ELAPSE.
Version: 0.1.5
Authors@R: 
    person("Berend", "Veldthuis", , "b.veldthuis@umcg.nl", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Berend Veldthuis [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Berend Veldthuis <b.veldthuis@umcg.nl>
Description: PostcodElapse is an R-package for estimating the levels of air
  pollution including fine particulate matter (PM2.5), black carbon (BC), nitrogen
  dioxide (NO2) and ozone (O3) at postal code level in the Netherlands. The
  package utilizes the ELAPSE Land Use Regression model and a GeoPackage
  containing spatial data on all Dutch postal codes.
